1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:01,126
Can you move your eyes

2
00:00:01,126 --> 00:00:02,033
smoothly?

3
00:00:02,080 --> 00:00:04,033
Slide them across the room.

4
00:00:04,080 --> 00:00:05,400
Jumpy, right?

5
00:00:05,430 --> 00:00:07,410
Your eyes can't glide...

6
00:00:07,410 --> 00:00:08,524
without something

7
00:00:08,524 --> 00:00:09,033
to CHASE.

8
00:00:10,450 --> 00:00:11,567
Hold up a finger.

9
00:00:11,620 --> 00:00:12,984
Move it slowly...

10
00:00:12,984 --> 00:00:14,000
and chase it.

11
00:00:14,030 --> 00:00:15,140
Smooth!

12
00:00:15,140 --> 00:00:15,734
Your eyes hitch

13
00:00:15,734 --> 00:00:16,767
a ride on it.

14
00:00:16,990 --> 00:00:18,433
Even in pitch dark,

15
00:00:18,480 --> 00:00:19,261
they'll still ride

16
00:00:19,261 --> 00:00:20,160
your finger...

17
00:00:20,160 --> 00:00:21,367
because your brain

18
00:00:21,390 --> 00:00:23,500
FEELS it move.

19
00:00:23,580 --> 00:00:25,160
Now lose the finger.

20
00:00:25,160 --> 00:00:26,200
Try again.

